{
  "name": "add-coder",
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "private": false,
  "description": "[codein2027](https://github.com/xiaomingming92/codein2027) - A complete scaffolding for building the ADD programming paradigm, the implementation layer for AI code governance. Core principle: Audit as Infrastructure. Breaks the black-box programming process and cross-session amnesia, evolving programming paradigms into an auditable, traceable, and convergent new era. npx-ready.\n\n[codein2027](https://github.com/xiaomingming92/codein2027) 快速构建 ADD 编程范式的完整脚手架——AI 代码治理的落地方案。以「审计即基础设施」为核心，彻底打破编程过程黑盒与跨轮失忆，让编程范式进化为可审计、可追溯、可收敛的新时代。npx 即用，人人可体验。",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/xiaomingming92/add-coder.git"
  },
  "type": "module",
  "bin": {
    "add-coder": "bin/add-coder.js"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./dist/index.js",
    "./config": "./dist/config/schema.js",
    "./renderer": "./dist/core/renderer.js"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "packageManager": "pnpm@11.9.0",
  "files": [
    "bin",
    "dist",
    "templates"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsup",
    "prepare": "tsup && tsx scripts/gen-src-hash.ts",
    "predev": "npm run db:ensure",
    "dev": "tsup --watch",
    "db:ensure": "bash scripts/db-ensure.sh",
    "sync": "bash scripts/sync-magic-dirs.sh",
    "lint": "eslint src/",
    "lint:fix": "eslint src/ --fix",
    "generate": "tsx src/caijuehub/transcribe.ts",
    "podman-add-coder-up": "podman-compose --env-file .env.development -f podman-compose.add.yml up -d",
    "podman-add-coder-down": "podman-compose --env-file .env.development -f podman-compose.add.yml down",
    "test": "vitest run"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "add",
    "add-paradigm",
    "claude",
    "qoder",
    "vscode",
    "mcp",
    "workflow",
    "codein2027",
    "裁决层",
    "caijuehub"
  ],
  "author": "xiaomingming",
  "email": "wujixmm@gmail.com",
  "license": "AGPL-3.0-only",
  "dependencies": {
    "@modelcontextprotocol/server": "2.0.0-beta.5",
    "commander": "^13.1.0",
    "smol-toml": "^1.7.0",
    "zod": "^4.4.3"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@prisma/adapter-libsql": "^7.0.0",
    "@prisma/adapter-pg": "^7.0.0",
    "@prisma/client": "^7.0.0",
    "dotenv": "*",
    "prisma": "^7.0.0",
    "tsx": ">=4"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "@prisma/client": {
      "optional": false
    },
    "prisma": {
      "optional": false
    },
    "dotenv": {
      "optional": false
    },
    "tsx": {
      "optional": false
    },
    "@prisma/adapter-pg": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "@prisma/adapter-libsql": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@eslint/js": "^9.39.4",
    "@types/node": "^22.20.1",
    "eslint": "^9.39.4",
    "tsup": "^8.4.0",
    "typescript": "^6.0.3",
    "typescript-eslint": "^8.62.1",
    "vitest": "^4.1.10"
  }
}
